1	 0SOMEWHERE NEARBY IS COLOSSAL CAVE, WHERE OTHERS HAVE FOUND
1	 0FORTUNES IN TREASURE AND GOLD, THOUGH IT IS RUMORED
1	 0THAT SOME WHO ENTER ARE NEVER SEEN AGAIN. MAGIC IS SAID
1	 0TO WORK IN THE CAVE.  I WILL BE YOUR EYES AND HANDS. DIRECT
1	 0ME WITH COMMANDS OF 1 OR 2 WORDS.
1	 0(ERRORS, SUGGESTIONS, COMPLAINTS TO CROWTHER)
1	 0(IF STUCK TYPE HELP FOR SOME HINTS)
2	 0A LITTLE DWARF WITH A BIG KNIFE BLOCKS YOUR WAY.
3	 0A LITTLE DWARF JUST WALKED AROUND A CORNER,SAW YOU, THREW
3	 0A LITTLE AXE AT YOU WHICH MISSED, CURSED, AND RAN AWAY.
4	 0THERE IS A THREATENING LITTLE DWARF IN THE ROOM WITH YOU!
5	 0ONE SHARP NASTY KNIFE IS THROWN AT YOU!
6	 0HE GETS YOU!
7	 0NONE OF THEM HIT YOU!
8	 0A HOLLOW VOICE SAYS 'PLUGH'
9	 0THERE IS NO WAY TO GO THAT DIRECTION.
10	 0I AM UNSURE HOW YOU ARE FACING. USE COMPASS POINTS OR
10	 0NEARBY OBJECTS.
11	 0I DON'T KNOW IN FROM OUT HERE. USE COMPASS POINTS OR NAME
11	 0SOMETHING IN THE GENERAL DIRECTION YOU WANT TO GO.
12	 0I DON'T KNOW HOW TO APPLY THAT WORD HERE.
13	 0I DON'T UNDERSTAND THAT!
14	 0I ALWAYS UNDERSTAND COMPASS DIRECTIONS, OR YOU CAN NAME
14	 0A NEARBY THING TO HEAD THAT WAY.
15	 0SORRY, BUT I AM NOT ALLOWED TO GIVE MORE DETAIL. I WILL
15	 0REPEAT THE LONG DESCRIPTION OF YOUR LOCATION.
16	 0IT IS NOW PITCH BLACK. IF YOU PROCEED YOU WILL LIKELY
16	 0FALL INTO A PIT.
17	 0IF YOU PREFER, SIMPLY TYPE W RATHER THAN WEST.
18	 0ARE YOU TRYING TO CATCH THE BIRD?
19	 0THE BIRD IS FRIGHTENED RIGHT NOW AND YOU CANNOT CATCH IT
19	 0NO MATTER WHAT YOU TRY. PERHAPS YOU MIGHT TRY LATER.
20	 0ARE YOU TRYING TO ATTACK OR AVOID THE SNAKE?
21	 0YOU CAN'T KILL THE SNAKE, OR DRIVE IT AWAY, OR AVOID IT,
21	 0OR ANYTHING LIKE THAT. THERE IS A WAY TO GET BY, BUT YOU
21	 0DON'T HAVE THE NECESSARY RESOURCES RIGHT NOW.
22	 0MY WORD FOR HITTING SOMETHING WITH THE ROD IS 'STRIKE'.
23	 0YOU FELL INTO A PIT AND BROKE EVERY BONE IN YOUR BODY!
24	 0YOU ARE ALREADY CARRYING IT!
25	 0YOU CAN'T BE SERIOUS!
26	 0THE BIRD WAS UNAFRAID WHEN YOU ENTERED, BUT AS YOU APPROACH
26	 0IT BECOMES DISTURBED AND YOU CANNOT CATCH IT.
27	 0YOU CAN CATCH THE BIRD, BUT YOU CANNOT CARRY IT.
28	 0THERE IS NOTHING HERE WITH A LOCK!
29	 0YOU AREN'T CARRYING IT!
30	 0THE LITTLE BIRD ATTACKS THE GREEN SNAKE, AND IN AN
30	 0ASTOUNDING FLURRY DRIVES THE SNAKE AWAY.
31	 0YOU HAVE NO KEYS!
32	 0IT HAS NO LOCK.
33	 0I DON'T KNOW HOW TO LOCK OR UNLOCK SUCH A THING.
34	 0THE GRATE WAS ALREADY LOCKED.
35	 0THE GRATE IS NOW LOCKED.
36	 0THE GRATE WAS ALREADY UNLOCKED.
37	 0THE GRATE IS NOW UNLOCKED.
38	 0YOU HAVE NO SOURCE OF LIGHT.
39	 0YOUR LAMP IS NOW ON.
